=== 5. the event-rate problem, stated as a power calculation ===
  panel-unanimous rate per attempt 0.0533  ->  3.20 of 60 targets per execution
  to detect 1.20x at 80% power you need about 135 replicates (17.3 core-h per arm at the step-2 budget)
  to detect 1.36x at 80% power you need about 45 replicates (5.7 core-h per arm at the step-2 budget)
  to detect 1.50x at 80% power you need about 24 replicates (3.1 core-h per arm at the step-2 budget)
  to detect 2.00x at 80% power you need about 7 replicates (0.9 core-h per arm at the step-2 budget)
